---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | TRAKNOVA"
  description="Terms of use for the TRAKNOVA website, including product information, inquiries and intellectual property."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span>
        <h1>Terms of<br /><em>Use.</em></h1>
        <p>The conditions that apply to this website and to general product information published on it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrap legal">
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 5 November 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Website use</h2>
        <p>You may use this website for lawful business evaluation and purchasing purposes. You must not attempt to disrupt the site, gain unauthorized access to it, or use it in a way that infringes the rights of others.</p>

        <h2>2. Product information</h2>
        <p>Product descriptions, images and specifications are provided for general information. Only the approved datasheet and the quotation for your specific configuration are authoritative. Module availability, memory, operating system versions, protection ratings and regional approvals vary by model and market.</p>

        <h2>3. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>The site content, brand, graphics and text are owned by or licensed to TRAKNOVA. You may not reproduce, modify or distribute them for commercial use without written permission.</p>

        <h2>4. Inquiries and quotations</h2>
        <p>Submitting an inquiry or requesting a datasheet does not create a contract. Quotations, orders, delivery and supply terms are governed by the applicable commercial agreement between the parties.</p>

        <h2>5. Third-party links</h2>
        <p>Links to third-party sites are provided for convenience. We are not responsible for their content, availability or privacy practices.</p>

        <h2>6. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>The website is provided on an “as is” basis to the extent permitted by law. We do not warrant that it will be uninterrupted, error-free or free of harmful components.</p>

        <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>To the extent permitted by law, TRAKNOVA is not liable for indirect or consequential loss arising from the use of this website. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded by law.</p>

        <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws applicable to the TRAKNOVA operating entity. The applicable jurisdiction is confirmed in the commercial agreement.</p>

        <h2>9. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows the latest revision.</p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these terms, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
